<title>USA: Videonics sees Q1 loss $2.0 to $2.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Videonics sees Q1 loss $2.0 to $2.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAMPBELL, Calif. 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Videonics Inc said that it anticipates a loss of $2.0 to $2.5 million on lower revenue for its first quarter ending March 31.</p>
<p>In a statement released late on Friday, Videonics said it expects to report revenue of $4.2 to $4.8 million.</p>
<p>The loss includes at least $1.25 million in pre-tax non-recurring charges, the company said. It did not give details of the charges.</p>
<p>Videonics reported a net profit of $449,000 or $0.08 a share on revenues of $7.1 million the previous first quarter.</p>
